OL,3,AAlmost 1,000 arrested as clashes follow
OL,4,Aanother day of mass protests across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 1,000 arrests were made as
OL,8,Fhundreds of thousands of people took
OL,9,Fpart in another day of protests across
OL,10,FFrance which were followed by some
OL,11,Fclashes late on Saturday, officials
OL,12,Fhave said.
OL,14,FAfter a day of largely peaceful
OL,15,Fdemonstrations, police fired tear gas
OL,16,Fand water cannon to disperse protesters
OL,17,Fin a number of cities including Paris,
OL,18,Fwhile barricades were set alight in
OL,19,FMarseille and people ripped boards from
OL,20,Fa shop in Bordeaux.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
