OL,3,AAlmost 1,000 arrested as clashes follow
OL,4,Aanother day of mass protests across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut officials have so far managed to
OL,8,Favoid rioting and looting on the scale
OL,9,Fseen last weekend, which resulted in
OL,10,Fsome of the worst scenes of disorder in
OL,11,FFrance's modern history.
OL,13,FThe interior ministry said an estimated
OL,14,F410,000 people protested on Saturday,
OL,15,Fwhile the unions put the number at
OL,16,Fabout 800,000.
